  "takeaways": [
    "Observation: you can point at it.",
    "Interpretation: a hedged read of the evidence.",
    "Unsupported claim: who, why or what will happen. Don’t build trades on it."
  ],
  "remember": "If you can’t prove the story, don’t build your trade around it."
